%%body
{
  Wood golems were particularly cute and useful, the little guys could organize items in chests given the right motivation, all for the low price of some mana crystals you had lying around.

    @ Nori "I found the source."

  Oh?

    @ Nori "A large mana signature, three more are emerging as I send this message, but they have not entered the world as of yet."

  So other things can happen is what he's saying.

    @ Nori "Precisely."

  Following Nori's coordinates, you find the source of the disturbance, a tortured spirit mumbling to itself in an unknown language.

    @ Nori "That is the source of the wood golems, no worries it is safe to neutralize."

  Are you sure?

    @ Nori "The world has already claimed the little ones, this thing however..."

  Yeah "thing" is a good description for the disturbed existence.

  It seemed less in pain, and more... driven by anger.

}
%date 2026-08-15
